# Build output must never be copied into an image: the local obj/ directories carry
# project.assets.json files with absolute paths from the host, which overwrite the ones
# restore just produced inside the container and break the publish.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/

.git/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

**/.env
**/*.user
**/TestResults/
